flowchart TD
  A([Start])
  B[Get the pizzeria name, the pizza price and the slice count]
  C[Work out the cost per slice: price divided by slices]
  D{Is the cost per slice at or under $2.00?}
  E[Report that it is a good deal]
  F[Report that it costs more than we agreed to pay]
  Z([End])
  A --> B
  B --> C
  C --> D
  D -->|yes| E
  D -->|no| F
  E --> Z
  F --> Z
